      "ids": [],
      "order": 0
    },
    "skillsIds": {
      "ids": [],
      "order": 0
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Builds a resume PDF from items the user already stored, picked by id. Requires login.

  Body:
  - `titleId`, `professionalSummaryId`: one id each
  - `socialMediaIds`, `experienceIds`, `educationIds`, `certificationIds`, `skillsIds`: `{ "ids": [GUIDs], "order": 0 }`. `order` is `0` (as sent), `1` (ascending) or `2` (descending).

  Only your own items are used. Get the ids from `get-user-resume-details` or from the Add requests.

  Returns `200` with a PDF (`application/pdf`). `400` if the PDF cannot be made. `413` if the body is over 256 KB. `429` after 10 PDFs a minute for one user, or when the server is already making too many PDFs.
}
